      "text": "The standard public phishing dataset's famous 99% accuracy is a\nCOLLECTION ARTEFACT: 100% of its “legitimate” URLs are tidy\nhttps://www.domain homepages. Train on that and you score 0.99\nwhile flagging SEBI's own website. We ship the honest 0.66.",
